<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Settler attacks on Palestinian villages in the West Bank continue, with Israeli officials labeling them as Jewish terrorism and urging police, not the IDF, to intervene. Israeli forces have detained dozens during a raid on a West Bank refugee camp and have been accused of a 350% surge in attacks on medics there. In Gaza, Israeli bombardment has been described as creating a toxic wasteland, cutting off vital hearing-aid supplies and prompting reports of environmental crimes affecting 99% of the enclave. The conflict has resulted in 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/22/netanyahu-rival-condemns-settler-arson-attacks-palestinian-villages-west-bank&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168836&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPTjdScTlzLXZWS0Q1dEdTY21EcE1MV21BZjhLMkJyZ2lKbElwZFNlTF80UTFHb2JoR2NpeUN1Wk83cGNHcW9iY0UwVDQ4eFdHdTItLW5hdmhxODRxbHZtMV9oNENOSndKc1hFS3MwTUh2M3d0YkJEUmJ6X0NkWkxOSnpmX3MtLUhIU0RncjNyX3A?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQN0FWa3VKSDl4VE0zQ2g1SGxtV3RFWGlzMGhsd0xub0E1NUhvVXIxZWJaT3ZNb3NSaHM2cERJM3pvY1Z0bmZlV3JRaTFTdDNCTTYxQ1NSb3FHeVJkcnZodG9XSERVTkJCOWN6WjVBdE9vbmdsVFNMVTlLUHJRTjZmd3NxM293QjB0TVRjQUJ5ZTdmRjNnUHZpNjcxZ0J2WF9iZ3ZXRFloanhmbFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Pittsburgh Jewish Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQXzJ1SlZwNVd6OWVKTnUwd0I2VzNrZkN0VnFWV1R2VEh3VVVibXNnUHVNRDFhZUc1OEdFSjlDcVlfVjhMZ1NaQzNiQXBDaktvMzNPWk5kNXZjWWl6Qm51bVRqMVlMNkJYVzYxY0RnVFdlRUxiTEZGZ3MwTk52d0p0SjdFYnktU0UzNnVyUHMzeHRDUWotN0JpWUR